UltraFastRng512 broad benchmark: V1
policy=one-core complete; Front + Back A/B remain on the same core
chunks=1024 generation=1048576 runs=3
host cpu=0; all benchmark engines pin their Front/Back to that core

=== MC option surface / selector coverage ===
AUTO                         selector=eligible selected=R2_CACHE8 lanes=8 precompute=1 score=100
BASELINE                     selector=eligible selected=BASELINE lanes=1 precompute=0 score=0
VEC8                         selector=eligible selected=VEC8 lanes=8 precompute=0 score=0
PARAM8_SHARED                selector=eligible selected=PARAM8_SHARED lanes=8 precompute=0 score=0
PARAM4_PRECOMPUTE            selector=eligible selected=PARAM4_PRECOMPUTE lanes=4 precompute=1 score=0
PARAM8_PRECOMPUTE            selector=eligible selected=PARAM8_PRECOMPUTE lanes=8 precompute=1 score=0
PARAM4_PRECOMPUTE_INVARIANT  selector=eligible selected=PARAM4_PRECOMPUTE_INVARIANT lanes=4 precompute=1 score=0
PATH8_BLOCK                  selector=eligible selected=PATH8_BLOCK lanes=8 precompute=0 score=0
PATH4X2                      selector=eligible selected=PATH4X2 lanes=4 precompute=0 score=0
PATH4                        selector=eligible selected=PATH4 lanes=4 precompute=0 score=0
R2_CACHE8                    selector=eligible selected=R2_CACHE8 lanes=8 precompute=1 score=0
NOTE: PATH8_BLOCK/PATH4X2/PATH4 remain manual/path-specific surfaces; the current generic Finance/Pharma q256 bridge does not execute them.

=== Core transport / final-profile throughput ===
AUTO -> DIRECT/R2        47.192 Gsamples/s median | runs=3
DIRECT / R2_FLOAT32      43.962 Gsamples/s median | runs=3
DIRECT / FLOAT32         21.771 Gsamples/s median | runs=3
DIRECT / INT32           21.990 Gsamples/s median | runs=3
DIRECT / RAW_INT16       15.680 Gsamples/s median | runs=3
L1_CACHE / FLOAT32       9.639 Gsamples/s median | runs=3
L2_CACHE / FLOAT32       9.537 Gsamples/s median | runs=3

