=== Integrated Pharma optimization options ===
PHARM    AUTO                         0.921 Gsamples/s median | runs=3
PHARM    BASELINE                     0.120 Gsamples/s median | runs=3
PHARM    VEC8                         0.110 Gsamples/s median | runs=3
PHARM    PARAM8_SHARED                0.527 Gsamples/s median | runs=3
PHARM    PARAM4_PRECOMPUTE            0.533 Gsamples/s median | runs=3
PHARM    PARAM8_PRECOMPUTE            0.539 Gsamples/s median | runs=3
PHARM    PARAM4_PRECOMPUTE_INVARIANT  0.916 Gsamples/s median | runs=3

Notes:
- DIRECT/R2_FLOAT32 is the intended first-run speed showcase.
- VEC8 currently shares the deliberate baseline body in the integrated Finance/Pharma consumer.
- PARAM8_PRECOMPUTE currently shares the common optimized body unless the invariant specialization is selected.
- PATH8_BLOCK/PATH4X2/PATH4 are retained manual/path-specific options, not silently presented as end-to-end domain speeds.
- Numbers from this tour are engineering references, not formal cross-machine claims.
